 refresh('the-refund-loop-explained','Using an STR Tax Refund to Buy the Next Property (2026)','The Refund Loop: Can a Tax Refund Fund the Next Property?','Can an STR tax refund fund your next purchase? Check CPA eligibility, cleared cash and a no-refund budget before committing to the next property.',BODY+keep[0],FAQ,'2026-08-15','data-refund-loop-correction-link','Use the <a href="/blog/the-refund-loop-explained/">refund-to-next-purchase cash register</a>. A deduction estimate is not a cleared receipt, and a later refund cannot fund an earlier commitment.')
